activity Threat Identify
activity Threat Examine
activity Threat Prioritize
activity Threat Mitigate
activity Threat Document
activity Threat Assess
bind Threat Identify: State Threat
bind Threat Examine: Degree Threat, Rating Effect
bind Threat Prioritize: Degree Threat
bind Threat Mitigate: Strategy Mitigation
bind Threat Document: State Threat
bind Threat Assess: Time Response
Degree Threat: integer between 1 and 10
Rating Effect: float between 0.0 and 100.0
State Threat: Identified, Analyzed, Mitigated, Reported
Strategy Mitigation: Isolation, Patch, Monitor
Time Response: integer between 1 and 72
Init[Threat Identify] | |
End[Threat Assess] | |
Chain Response[Threat Identify, Threat Examine] | | |0,2,h
Response[Threat Examine, Threat Prioritize] | | |
Precedence[Threat Mitigate, Threat Prioritize] |A.Degree Threat > 5 | |
Response[Threat Mitigate, Threat Document] | | |
Chain Succession[Threat Document, Threat Assess] |A.State Threat is Reported | |
Existence[Threat Examine] | |
Chain Response[Threat Mitigate, Threat Assess] | | |0,48,h
Not Chain Succession[Threat Mitigate, Threat Mitigate] | |A.Strategy Mitigation != T.Strategy Mitigation |